{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111968","id":2942059928,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6vXEWY","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111968","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111968.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111968.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111968","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111968/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111968/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111968/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0ed8dfe5096704042bb31f00ce32a7b7b5edc5fb","number":111968,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix SDFGI dynamic light culling with Y-scaled cascades","user":{"login":"zuedev","id":24614929,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NjE0OTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24614929?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev","html_url":"https://github.com/zuedev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Resolves #111723\r\n\r\nSDFGI dynamic lights are incorrectly culled when positioned at high or low Y coordinates (e.g., Y=±200) with non-100% Y scale settings.\r\n\r\n### Root Cause\r\n\r\nSDFGI stores cascade positions in Y-scaled grid space. When a world position is processed, it's transformed by multiplying Y by `y_mult`:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nworld_position.y *= y_mult;  // Enter Y-scaled grid space\r\ncascade.position = ...; // Stored in Y-scaled space\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhen converting back to world space for bounds checking, the inverse transform `* Vector3(1, 1.0 / y_mult, 1)` must be applied. This pattern is used correctly throughout the codebase (e.g., `get_pending_region_data()` at line ~2101).\r\n\r\nHowever, `pre_process_gi()` at line ~1931 was missing this inverse transform when constructing the `cascade_aabb` for light culling:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\ncascade_aabb.position = Vector3(...) * cascade.cell_size;\r\n// Missing: * Vector3(1, 1.0 / y_mult, 1)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis caused `cascade_aabb` (in Y-scaled grid space) and `light_aabb` (in world space) to be compared in different coordinate systems, resulting in incorrect culling.\r\n\r\n### The Fix\r\n\r\nApply the inverse Y-scale transform to convert cascade bounds to world space:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\ncascade_aabb.position = Vector3(...) * cascade.cell_size * Vector3(1, 1.0 / y_mult, 1);\r\ncascade_aabb.size = Vector3(...) * cascade.cell_size * Vector3(1, 1.0 / y_mult, 1);\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis matches the pattern used in `get_pending_region_data()` and ensures both AABBs are in the same coordinate space for intersection testing.\r\n\r\nNote: This bug was masked when `y_mult=1.0` (100% Y-scale), as the inverse transform becomes a no-op.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5796,"closed_issues":0,"created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:35:07Z","closed_at":null,"due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-10-23T20:41:38Z","updated_at":"2026-05-18T21:41:09Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"a2c5fdcca603563e73a8d45a69d88cde4a97be54"